  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "1 cup butter, softened",
    "2 eggs",
    "1 cup sour cream",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1.625 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "1 cup fresh or frozen blueberries",
    "0.5 cup brown sugar",
    "0.5 cup chopped pecans",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 tablespoon confectioners' sugar for dusting"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease and flour a 9-inch Bundt pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GdO44nQ089ZM98ZR0GVOoVtHmr8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/70828-blueberry-sour-cream-coffee-cake-ddmfs-3248-4x3-step-01-52481cc695aa427f8dabc7b67781ec78.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/70828/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat sugar and butter together in a large bowl with an electric mixer until light and fluffy. Add eggs, one at a time, beating well after each addition. Beat in sour cream and vanilla extract. Combine flour, baking powder, and salt; stir into butter mixture until just blended. Fold in blueberries.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hYdYfPcaw6kEjJwO_p2msSev54Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/70828-blueberry-sour-cream-coffee-cake-ddmfs-3249-4x3-step-02-c33c2c353e7b4220ba50a921773e1b40.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/70828/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon 1/2 of the batter into the prepared pan. Combine brown sugar, pecans, and cinnamon in a small bowl; sprinkle 1/2 of the mixture over batter in the pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JgcVttiLBsXJyU7COx_njYuc5W8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/70828-blueberry-sour-cream-coffee-cake-ddmfs-3254-4x3-step-03-cdd9f15d93604516a07141ab0d70b0d2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/70828/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon remaining batter on top, then sprinkle over remaining pecan mixture. Use a knife or thin spatula to swirl the sugar layer into the cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DldN03OosBD_vLUT7c88afVKCLw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/70828-blueberry-sour-cream-coffee-cake-ddmfs-3259-4x3-step-04-2d19ab2cacec43b2922ee974d69e6f99.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/70828/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean, about 1 hour to 1 hour 15 minutes. Let cake cool in the pan for 15 minutes before inverting. Invert carefully onto a serving plate; dust with confectioners' sugar just before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cOPFUdQ_Ek_EUrtoUW28QRE13hw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/70828-blueberry-sour-cream-coffee-cake-ddmfs-3276-4x3-step-05-482809eb541842e2ab9d6ace7855b8c7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/70828/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OWYbaNB4smUJFfbNeLQVm1qy4SI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/70828-blueberry-sour-cream-coffee-cake-ddmfs-3378-4x3-beauty-0e65eefaaffc46b9b050add66c338f1b.jpg"
      ],
